[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4083.43, "timestamp": "01:08:03", "text": "咖啡店。那真有趣。这是我第一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4085.829, "timestamp": "01:08:05", "text": "在猫咪咖啡馆里，看到所有这些景象就像是度过了一段美好的时光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4089.91, "timestamp": "01:08:09", "text": "毛茸茸的猫咪之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4093.91, "timestamp": "01:08:13", "text": "真好。孩子们最棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4096.07, "timestamp": "01:08:16", "text": "太好吃了，而且味道很棒，但是它们非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4099.51, "timestamp": "01:08:19", "text": "可爱的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4101.59, "timestamp": "01:08:21", "text": "哦，我只想喝点水。我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4106.749, "timestamp": "01:08:26", "text": "吃。喝水。补水"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4110.789, "timestamp": "01:08:30", "text": "每个人。喝。喝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4114.789, "timestamp": "01:08:34", "text": "所以你最期待去那里做什么？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4117.476, "timestamp": "01:08:37", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "SASAGEYO"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4117.669, "timestamp": "01:08:37", "text": "我很期待看到很多风景。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4121.749, "timestamp": "01:08:41", "text": "还有一些其他的东西。主要是，嗯，主要是关于这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4124.709, "timestamp": "01:08:44", "text": "像个独立人士，我孤身一人，孤身一人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4131.229, "timestamp": "01:08:51", "text": "我现在就在那里，我必须尽力而为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4135.59, "timestamp": "01:08:55", "text": "嗯，是的，我要活下去，而且所有事情都要自己做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4137.91, "timestamp": "01:08:57", "text": "这段时间以来，我的父母一直都在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4139.99, "timestamp": "01:08:59", "text": "就像宠爱我、庇护我一样"}]